{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-09. It distinguishes missing (key absent) from explicit null via membership test before reading the value, accepts exact integer 5..14 inclusive, and returns {kind,lag} in every branch. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation was performed by this example reviewer.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-09", "description": "Classify raw lag: missing -> {kind:"missing",lag:null}; explicit null -> {kind:"null",lag:null}; exact integer 5..14 -> {kind:"integer",lag:original}; other -> {kind:"invalid",lag:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. Uses a helper invoked at module scope; assigns its returned object to result. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 remain prerequisites.", "content": "def classify_lag(mapping):
    if 'lag' not in mapping:
        return {'kind': 'missing', 'lag': None}
    value = mapping['lag']
    if value is None:
        return {'kind': 'null', 'lag': None}
    if type(value) is int and 5 <= value <= 14:
        return {'kind': 'integer', 'lag': value}
    return {'kind': 'invalid', 'lag': None}
result = classify_lag(inputs)"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
